      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹5.14 (vs ₹4.57 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.14 (up from ₹4.57 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹9.66b (up 5.1% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹661.0m (up 13% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.8% (up from 6.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 7.6% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Luxury industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 13% per year whereas the company’s share price has fallen by 16% per year.",
